{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-project-item-js","path":"/projects/ckeditor-weekend-video-series/","result":{"data":{"kontentItemProject":{"system":{"id":"dc8349b4-2049-49fd-b4d3-d199e99f2db0"},"elements":{"title":{"value":"CKEditor weekend video series"},"release_date":{"value":"2025-05-25T22:00:00Z"},"source_code_url":{"value":"https://github.com/Simply007/ondrejs-notes"},"live_url":{"value":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLKzl1AGxt2J0j2H3xUuFLGO-s_-f0K9eD"},"summary":{"value":"<p>I started with <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Simply007-cz\" data-new-window=\"true\" title=\"Youtube @Simply007-cz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">my personal YouTube channe</a>l, where I shared a typical coding videos. In this series, I vibe-coded a clone of the Google Keep app, showcasing how to build a notes application from scratch. The second part focused on enhancing the app by integrating CKEditor for rich-text editing, making it a powerful tool for managing notes. Finally, I demonstrated the inclusion of CKEditor's real-time collaboration features, allowing multiple users to edit notes simultaneously and view revision histories.</p>"},"image":{"value":[{"url":"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/6aec6c2a-3010-01c9-8295-4d988333f15d/05ba2861-3588-42c8-ae96-cb63bee4a1c7/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jun%209%2C%202025%2C%2011_47_32%20AM.png","width":1536,"height":1024,"description":null}]},"content":{"value":"<h2>Project Overview — “Notes App from Zero to Hero”</h2>\n<p>A three-part, hands-on series that starts with a blank prompt and ends with a fully featured, <strong>CKEditor-powered</strong>, real-time-collaborative notes app (React 18 + Vite + TS).</p>\n<object type=\"application/kenticocloud\" data-type=\"item\" data-rel=\"component\" data-codename=\"n3843bcd5_fb78_012b_efd4_c787a39f9b8a\"></object>\n<h3><br></h3>\n<h3>Part 1 – Build &amp; Deploy the Base App</h3>\n<p><em>Video #1:</em> <strong>“AI Vibe-Coding a Google-Keep-Style Notes App”</strong></p>\n<object type=\"application/kenticocloud\" data-type=\"item\" data-rel=\"component\" data-codename=\"n420eb7c0_6611_01bd_02ea_371887994914\"></object>\n<object type=\"application/kenticocloud\" data-type=\"item\" data-rel=\"component\" data-codename=\"n686a4a50_e282_015f_8d62_79118aca6bac\"></object>\n<p>Key takeaways:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Cursor’s <em>Vibe Coding</em> scaffolds Vite + React + TS in one prompt.</li>\n  <li>Adds React Router, GUID utils &amp; LocalStorage CRUD.</li>\n  <li>Pushes to GitHub and deploys to Vercel, fixing a lint-break on the way.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><br></h3>\n<h3>Part 2 – Rich-Text &amp; AI Assistant</h3>\n<p><em>Video #2:</em> <strong>“Turn a Textarea into a CKEditor 5 Powerhouse”</strong></p>\n<object type=\"application/kenticocloud\" data-type=\"item\" data-rel=\"component\" data-codename=\"n2de54776_02bd_01a8_d6b0_1575aed83bb3\"></object>\n<object type=\"application/kenticocloud\" data-type=\"item\" data-rel=\"component\" data-codename=\"n82f2842e_3cf9_0165_02c4_1f76d3fa26ac\"></object>\n<p><br>\nHighlights</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Uses CKEditor Builder to pick premium features (headings, lists, code-block, PDF export, OpenAI Assistant).</li>\n  <li>Wraps the generated build in a reusable <code>&lt;RichText /&gt;</code> component.</li>\n  <li>Two-way binds HTML to LocalStorage and re-deploys to Vercel.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><br></h3>\n<h3>Part 3 – Real-Time Collaboration</h3>\n<p><em>Video #3:</em> <strong>“From Solo Notes to Live Collaboration”</strong></p>\n<object type=\"application/kenticocloud\" data-type=\"item\" data-rel=\"component\" data-codename=\"n9eeecb87_4f17_01ba_b616_a61b9fece712\"></object>\n<object type=\"application/kenticocloud\" data-type=\"item\" data-rel=\"component\" data-codename=\"n68c946c5_4139_011f_14ac_39d3788c9c32\"></object>\n<p><br>\nWhat’s new</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Regenerates the editor build with <strong>Real-Time Collaboration</strong> &amp; <em>Revision History</em>.</li>\n  <li>Wires each note’s GUID as <code>channelId</code>, enabling multi-user rooms.</li>\n  <li>Simple share-by-URL flow and LocalStorage fallback for guests.</li>\n  <li>Live demo with two browsers; notes sync and diff viewer in action.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>📌 <strong>Next ideas:</strong> plug in auth &amp; a remote DB, polish race-conditions, refine user naming.<br>\n⭐️ Star / fork the repo &amp; drop feedback on GitHub, or Youtube!</p>\n<object type=\"application/kenticocloud\" data-type=\"item\" data-rel=\"component\" data-codename=\"n56ae9a26_f68d_01dd_3fa4_752bb67e2d99\"></object>","modular_content":[{"system":{"codename":"n3843bcd5_fb78_012b_efd4_c787a39f9b8a","type":"button"},"elements":{"icon":{"value":"fa-youtube"},"title":{"value":"Follow the YT Playlist"},"external_url":{"value":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLKzl1AGxt2J0j2H3xUuFLGO-s_-f0K9eD"},"link_to":{"value":[]}}},{"system":{"codename":"n420eb7c0_6611_01bd_02ea_371887994914","type":"button"},"elements":{"icon":{"value":"fa-youtube"},"title":{"value":"Video"},"external_url":{"value":"https://youtu.be/V02w3CK8KG4"},"link_to":{"value":[]}}},{"system":{"codename":"n686a4a50_e282_015f_8d62_79118aca6bac","type":"button"},"elements":{"icon":{"value":"fa-code-branch"},"title":{"value":"Code branch `notes-template`"},"external_url":{"value":"https://github.com/Simply007/ondrejs-notes/tree/notes-template"},"link_to":{"value":[]}}},{"system":{"codename":"n2de54776_02bd_01a8_d6b0_1575aed83bb3","type":"button"},"elements":{"icon":{"value":"fa-youtube"},"title":{"value":"Video"},"external_url":{"value":"https://youtu.be/LAGl6orIGRw"},"link_to":{"value":[]}}},{"system":{"codename":"n82f2842e_3cf9_0165_02c4_1f76d3fa26ac","type":"button"},"elements":{"icon":{"value":"fa-code-branch"},"title":{"value":"Code branch `ck-editor`"},"external_url":{"value":"https://github.com/Simply007/ondrejs-notes/tree/ck-editor"},"link_to":{"value":[]}}},{"system":{"codename":"n9eeecb87_4f17_01ba_b616_a61b9fece712","type":"button"},"elements":{"icon":{"value":"fa-youtube"},"title":{"value":"Video"},"external_url":{"value":"https://youtu.be/qn4FthLFvK4"},"link_to":{"value":[]}}},{"system":{"codename":"n68c946c5_4139_011f_14ac_39d3788c9c32","type":"button"},"elements":{"icon":{"value":"fa-code-branch"},"title":{"value":"Code branch `collaboration-features`"},"external_url":{"value":"https://github.com/Simply007/ondrejs-notes/tree/collaboration-features"},"link_to":{"value":[]}}},{"system":{"codename":"n56ae9a26_f68d_01dd_3fa4_752bb67e2d99","type":"button"},"elements":{"icon":{"value":"fa-github"},"title":{"value":"GitHub repository"},"external_url":{"value":"https://github.com/Simply007/ondrejs-notes"},"link_to":{"value":[]}}}],"images":[]}}}},"pageContext":{"language":"en-US","codename":"ckeditor_weekend_video_series"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2624379000","2660228588"],"slicesMap":{}}